# The image installs its own dependencies and builds its own output. Without
# this file `COPY . .` puts the host's on top of them, and a developer who has
# ever run `npm install` here ships macOS binaries into a linux image — or, more
# often, breaks the build outright with an error that names no file
# ("The \"id\" argument must be of type string. Received undefined").
node_modules
.next
out

# Never belongs in an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Noise that only invalidates the build cache
.git
.gitignore
*.log
.DS_Store
coverage
